  "name": "Asian Chicken Buddha Bowl",
  "subtitle": "Roasted vegetables, quinoa, chicken, and peanut-lime sauce",
  "description": "A balanced bowl of roasted sweet potato and onion, fluffy quinoa, ginger-garlic chicken, greens, avocado, and a creamy peanut-lime sauce.",
